{
  "info": {
    "name": "Virtuagym Public API (v1)",
    "description": "Club-scoped Virtuagym Public API v1 for fitness and health club management: members, employees, memberships, credits, invoices, visits (check-ins), events and participants, and coaching workout assignments. Base URL: https://api.virtuagym.com/api. All v1 requests authenticate with api_key and club_secret query parameters over HTTPS. Authoritative reference is access-gated (request via api@virtuagym.com); endpoints modeled from the publicly mirrored Virtuagym API wiki.",
